<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Privacy Policy</title>

<style>
body{
    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
    background:#f4f6f8;
    line-height:1.6;
}

header{
    background:#203a43;
    color:white;
    padding:20px;
    text-align:center;
}

.container{
    max-width:900px;
    margin:40px auto;
    background:white;
    padding:30px;
    border-radius:10px;
    box-shadow:0 5px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
}

h1,h2{
    color:#203a43;
}

footer{
    text-align:center;
    padding:20px;
    background:#203a43;
    color:white;
    margin-top:40px;
}

a{
    color:#203a43;
    text-decoration:none;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
<p>Last Updated: 2026</p>
</header>

<div class="container">

<h2>1. Introduction</h2>
<p>
This website is a personal project hosted on GitHub Pages. The purpose of this site
is to share information, resources, and personal projects. Protecting visitor privacy
is important, and this policy explains how information is handled.
</p>

<h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
<p>
This website does not intentionally collect personal information such as names,
email addresses, or financial information unless voluntarily provided through
contact forms or communication.
</p>

<p>However, some non-personal information may be automatically collected including:</p>
<ul>
<li>Browser type</li>
<li>Device information</li>
<li>IP address</li>
<li>Date and time of visit</li>
<li>Pages visited</li>
</ul>

<h2>3. Cookies</h2>
<p>
This website may use cookies or similar technologies to improve functionality
and understand how visitors interact with the site. Users can disable cookies
through their browser settings if desired.
</p>

<h2>4. Third-Party Services</h2>
<p>
Some pages may contain embedded content or links to third-party services such as
analytics tools, videos, or external websites. These services operate under their
own privacy policies.
</p>

<h2>5. Data Security</h2>
<p>
The website is hosted using secure infrastructure provided by GitHub Pages.
Reasonable efforts are made to maintain the security of the website and prevent
unauthorized access.
</p>

<h2>6. External Links</h2>
<p>
This website may contain links to external websites. The site owner is not
responsible for the privacy practices or content of those external sites.
</p>

<h2>7. Changes to This Policy</h2>
<p>
This privacy policy may be updated occasionally to reflect changes in technology
or website features. Users are encouraged to review this page periodically.
</p>

<h2>8. Contact</h2>
<p>
If you have any questions regarding this privacy policy, you may contact the
website owner through the contact information provided on this website or
through the GitHub repository.
</p>

</div>

<footer>
<p>© 2026 Personal Website | Hosted on GitHub Pages</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
